Zebra is a multi-server routing software package which provides TCP/IP
based routing protocols such as RIPv1, RIPv2, OSPFv2, OSPFv3, BGP-4,
BGP-4+ and so on.  Zebra turns your machine into a full powered router.

This is the Zebra Manual for zebra-@value{VERSION}.
