@chapter bgpd

bgpd is a Border Gateway Protocol 4 (BGP-4) protocol daemon.  BGP-4 is
described in RFC1771.  bgpd also supports Multi Protocol Extension for
BGP-4 (sometimes called as BGP-4+ or MBGP) which described in RFC2283.

BGP-4 is one of the EGP (Exterior Gateway Protocol) and used for inter
domain routing.  

