@chapter Route map

Route map is very useful functionality of zebra.  There is match and set
statement in route map.

@example
@group
route-map test permit 10
 match ip address 10
 set local-preference 200
@end group
@end example

This means if a route matches ip access-list number 10 then set it's
local-preference value to 200.

